---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Diamo" description="Learn about the idea and vision behind Diamo — cycle-synced fitness powered by science, community, and real connection.">
  <Navbar />
  <main class="about-page">
    <div class="about-container">
      
      <div class="about-hero">
        <h1 class="about-title">
          <span data-i18n="about.title">Your cycle is your superpower.</span><br/>
          <span class="about-title-italic" data-i18n="about.title.italic">We're here to unlock it.</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
      </div>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2 class="about-h2" data-i18n="about.story.title">Why Diamo exists</h2>
        <p data-i18n="about.story.p1">
          For too long, fitness has ignored the most fundamental part of female biology: The cycle. Training plans expected the same performance on day 5 and day 25. They made women feel like failures when their bodies simply needed something different.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n="about.story.p2">
          But the science is clear: Every woman moves through four distinct cycle phases, each shaping her energy, strength, and recovery in unique ways. This isn't a limitation — it's an advantage, if you know how to use it.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n="about.story.p3">
          That's why Diamo was built. The app that finally trains with your cycle, not against it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section about-vision">
        <h2 class="about-h2" data-i18n="about.vision.title">Training that speaks your cycle's language</h2>
        <p data-i18n="about.vision.p1">
          During your follicular phase, your body is ready to push limits. During your luteal phase, it needs a different kind of strength. Diamo knows the difference and adapts your training accordingly.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n="about.vision.p2">
          We connect the data from your Apple Watch, Oura Ring, or Garmin with real-time cycle awareness to create a plan that fits exactly where you are today. Not a generic plan. Your plan.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n="about.vision.p3">
          And because we believe the best workouts happen together, Diamo connects you with women near you who are in a similar cycle phase. Local run clubs, shared energy, real connections. <strong>Offline first</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2 class="about-h2" data-i18n="about.values.title">What we believe</h2>
        <p class="about-values-intro" data-i18n="about.values.intro">
          Diamo is built on a simple conviction: Women deserve fitness tools that truly understand their bodies. These are the principles that guide everything we create.
        </p>
        
        <div class="about-values-grid">
          <div class="about-value-card">
            <div class="about-value-icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2Z"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-value-name" data-i18n="about.value1.title">Science-backed</h3>
            <p class="about-value-desc" data-i18n="about.value1.desc">Every recommendation is rooted in real cycle science and sports physiology — not trends, not guesswork.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-value-card">
            <div class="about-value-icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-value-name" data-i18n="about.value2.title">Community first</h3>
            <p class="about-value-desc" data-i18n="about.value2.desc">The best workouts happen together. Diamo connects you with local women in similar cycle phases for real, offline training.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-value-card">
            <div class="about-value-icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-value-name" data-i18n="about.value3.title">Built for women</h3>
            <p class="about-value-desc" data-i18n="about.value3.desc">Not an afterthought. Not a pink version of a men's app. Diamo is designed from scratch around the female body and experience.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="about-cta">
        <h3 class="about-cta-title" data-i18n="about.cta.title">Sound like something you want to be part of?</h3>
        <p class="about-cta-text" data-i18n="about.cta.text">We're just getting started and that's what makes it special. Be there from the beginning.</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary about-cta-btn" data-i18n="about.cta.btn">
          Join the Waitlist
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-2xl));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  /* Hero */
  .about-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-title-italic {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-divider {
    width: 48px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--navy);
    opacity: 0.25;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-section p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-section p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Vision (dark) */
  .about-vision {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .about-vision .about-h2 {
    color: var(--ivory);
  }

  .about-vision p {
    color: rgba(251, 249, 246, 0.85);
  }

  .about-vision strong {
    color: var(--ivory);
  }

  /* Values Grid */
  .about-values-intro {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl) !important;
  }

  .about-values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-value-card {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(11, 25, 46, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .about-value-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(11, 25, 46, 0.16);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(11, 25, 46, 0.04);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about-value-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background: rgba(155, 139, 203, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--lavender);
  }

  .about-value-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .about-value-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* CTA */
  .about-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(11, 25, 46, 0.08);
  }

  .about-cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-cta-text {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-cta-btn {
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 320px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-vision {
      padding: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }
</style>

